      "body": "I’ve been running into an issue with my AYN Thor. The touch screen on the bottom is about 1cm off making typing impossible and games very difficult. This issue only happens in MelonDS, not when I’m on google or anything else for the AYN Thor. Is there any way to troubleshoot this or to calibrate my inputs?\n\n\nUpdate: it seems to work normally if I turn the “keep DS aspect ratio” toggle off. So if I play in stretched mode the touch inputs are perfectly accurate but not in the DS’s normal aspect ratio.",
