      "body": "Considering the Samsung Z Flip and Z Fold can provide a more close to reality experience with their foldable screens, it would be nice if actually closing them would close the emulated DS lid.\r\n\r\nCurrently locking the screen pauses emulation, but it would be even nicer if emulation continued for a few seconds (with a wake_lock) in order for the game to trigger actions when the lid is closed, and then actually pause emulation.\r\n\r\nNotable examples include Super Mario 64 DS which says \"Buh Bye!\" when closing the lid, and \"It's-a me, Mario!\" when opening it up.",
